{"product_id":"rule-of-four","title":"Rule Of Four","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"THE RUNAWAY NEW YORK TIMES\" BESTSELLER AT A NEW LOW PRICE! \"THE RULE OF FOUR\" Ian Caldwell Dustin Thomason Read by Josh Hamilton It's Easter at Princeton and two students, Tom Sullivan and Paul Harris, are a hair's breadth from solving the mysteries of the Hypnerotomachia Poliphili -- a renowned text attributed to an Italian nobleman, a work that has baffled scholars since its publication in 1499. But as their deadline looms, research has stalled -- until a long-lost diary surfaces with a vital clue. And when a fellow researcher is murdered just hours later, Tom and Paul realize that they are not the first to glimpse the Hypnerotomachia's secrets.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ian Caldwell | Dustin Thomason\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099451952\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Mass Market Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 521\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 110 x 174\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594362523801,"sku":"16RB-3-9780099451952","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/rule-of-four-315130.jpg?v=1694791334","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/rule-of-four","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}